{"name":"Arrowtown","hex":"#827a67","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Arrowtown","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["An old gold mining town in Otago, New Zealand."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Arrowtown"}],"entries":[{"title":"Arrowtown","blocks":[{"text":"Arrowtown is a historic gold mining town in the Otago region of the South Island of New Zealand. Arrowtown is located on the banks of the Arrow River approximately 7.5 km from State Highway 6. Arrowtown is located 19.5 kilometres to the east of Queenstown. It is reached by roads leading from State Highway 6 at Arrow Junction, or from Queenstown via Arthurs Point or Lake Hayes."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/NZL-arrowt-buckinghamstr.jpg/330px-NZL-arrowt-buckinghamstr.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arrowtown","wikidata":"Q703016"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Arrowtown_Pharmacy.jpg/500px-Arrowtown_Pharmacy.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Arrowtown_Pharmacy.jpg/1280px-Arrowtown_Pharmacy.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Arrowtown_Pharmacy.jpg/500px-Arrowtown_Pharmacy.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Amcal Arrowtown pharmacy","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AArrowtown_Pharmacy.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Autumn_in_Arrowtown%2C_New_Zealand.jpg/500px-Autumn_in_Arrowtown%2C_New_Zealand.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Autumn_in_Arrowtown%2C_New_Zealand.jpg/500px-Autumn_in_Arrowt